{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012FMEMVEwipSv6wSKmJXNen","type":"tool_result","content":"    3963 bridges/agy-bridge/server.py\n    6008 tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py\n    9971 total\n54:умолчанию: флаг `IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED` в `dynamic_config.json` (env `AGY_IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED`\n199:IMAGE_FLAG_NAME = \"IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED\"\n245:_retry_tenths: int = RETRY_CAPACITY_TENTHS\n258:# кэш IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED и реестр активных каталогов img-* (под _active_lock).\n264:_active_img_dirs: set[str] = set()\n618:class ImageReject(ValueError):\n628:class ImageSpoolError(RuntimeError):\n682:    \"\"\"IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED из dynamic_config.json: строго `true`, иначе False.\"\"\"\n695:def _is_image_input_enabled() -> bool:\n698:    Env `AGY_IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED` (непустой) решает сразу: 0|false|no|off -> False,\n700:    `IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED` в dynamic_config.json с кэшем TTL 1.0 с; не-boolean,\n704:    env = os.environ.get(\"AGY_IMAGE_INPUT_ENABLED\", \"\").strip().lower()\n771:    return _is_image_input_enabled() and _image_proof_reason(model_id) is None\n774:def _image_gate(model_id: str, effort: str | None) -> ImageReject | None:\n776:    if not _is_image_input_enabled():\n777:        return ImageReject(\"image_input_disabled\")\n782:        return ImageReject(reason)\n784:        return ImageReject(reason, \"unsupported_reasoning_effort\")\n786:    return ImageReject(\"image_proof_invalid\")\n830:def _new_img_dir() -> Path:\n835:def _collect_images(\n854:        raise ImageReject(\"images_disabled\")\n856:        raise ImageReject(\"too_many_images\", \"too_many_images\")\n867:    img_dir = _new_img_dir()\n873:            raise ImageReject(\"non_user_image\", \"invalid_image_content\")\n879:            raise ImageReject(\"invalid_image_url\", \"invalid_image_content\")\n881:            raise ImageReject(\"remote_or_file_url\", \"image_url_not_allowed\")\n884:            raise ImageReject(\"malformed_data_url\", \"invalid_image_conten