emain unproven; no council or author may label them measured PASS.\",\n    \"failure_matrix\": [\n      {\n        \"dependency\": \"local config read\",\n        \"path\": \"control/request TTL\",\n        \"timeout\": \"bounded file max existing DYNAMIC_CONFIG_MAX_BYTES; no network\",\n        \"bulkhead\": \"per-flag cache lock\",\n        \"failure\": \"fail-closed fallback flag ->strict; input flagoff in universal ->text-only\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"dependency\": \"spool FS\",\n        \"path\": \"hot/post-slot\",\n        \"timeout\": \"existing local FS behavior; no new unsupported hard deadline claim\",\n        \"bulkhead\": \"same execution slot, no new pool\",\n        \"failure\": \"typed ImageSpoolError->strip/CID reset/text; strict500 unchanged\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"dependency\": \"agy CLI/upstream\",\n        \"path\": \"hot\",\n        \"timeout\": \"existing queue900s/execution1800s/firstevent120s defaults; NOT SLA\",\n        \"bulkhead\": \"MAX_CONCURRENT default4, bounded body admission32; effective values release evidence required\",\n        \"failure\": \"eligible attempt1->1text retry; delivery/client_gone/done exclusions; second failure truthful; no new global breaker or routing architecture\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"dependency\": \"log sink\",\n        \"path\": \"hot transition\",\n        \"timeout\": \"existing synchronous stderr, not measured nonblocking latency\",\n        \"bulkhead\": \"existing _log\",\n        \"failure\": \"sanitize exact fields, no content; no fabricated dropped_total/async telemetry architecture\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"production_acceptance_blockers\": [\n      \"Measured quota/RPS/p99 and parent+child RSS/CPU/FD/ports closure with preserved admitted-body bounds\",\n      \"Disposition of inherited queue-waiter/deadline constraints vs live SLA, without pretending local tests satisfy highload gates\",\n      \"Reserve worst-case2N amplification safe for actual owner workload\",\n      \"21 deterministic HL/C-MULT/S-HERD/H-CPU/R-BULK oracle evidence or validated transitive non-applicability; none issued Stage2\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"handoff_state\": {\n    \"next_role\": \"Parent orchestrator: independent architecture panel, not Coder yet\",\n    \"architecture_authoring\": \"FINALIZED\",\n    \"external_arch_panel\": \"NOT_RUN\",\n    \"product_implementation\": \"NOT_STARTED\",\n    \"production_activation\": \"NOT_APPLIED\",\n    \"live_acceptance\": \"NOT_RUN\",\n    \"capacity_acceptance\": \"BLOCKED_UNMEASURED_PRODUCTION\",\n    \"warning\": \"Mechanical schema/fingerprint PASS is not council ACCEPT or proof that unresolved capacity gates pass. Do not start Coder without valid external architecture panel proof; do not promote to production without resource/live gates.\"\n  },\n  \"owner_questions\": [\n    \"ASSUMP-01/02 are continuable explicit assumptions: real successful text200, no fabricated backend success; decodable positive corpus with signature-only validation. No answer required to finish this design.\",\n    \"For production capacity acceptance supply measured/contractual p99 SLA, peak workload and upstream quotas; missing facts remain blocking release evidence, not invented numbers.\"\n  ],\n  \"tooling_deviations\": [\n    \"Requested skill and validator locations omit universal/; actual files found via skill INDEX and read from canonical universal paths.\",\n    \"Actual role validator uses positional PLAN --phase before|after; before-fingerprint argument unsupported. Supplied plans/architect-01.before.json is worktree schema2.0, not a role plan; retained immutable; separate initial role plan provided.\",\n    \"Actual arch validator needs --packet,--run-dir,--role-plan,--repo-root,--fingerprint-before,--fingerprint-after,--task,--receipt; prints PASS: ARCH_GATE rather than ARCH_GATE_VALID. No wrapper/verifier-output spoof created.\",\n    \"Supplied fingerprint includes .ai-team/runs artifacts and concurrent log writes. Original retained; derive product projection by excluding ONLY .ai-team/runs/** from ORIGINAL manifest, recomputing digest, comparing current identically scoped snapshot. No fresh/rebased baseline.\",\n    \"Existing health.images bool and _cid_release(cid,turn_id) override inaccurate proposed shapes/signature; all external behavior design remains as requested.\",\n    \"Actual test baseline is6008lines; entire blob is immutable, not guessed6009 line count.\"\n  ],\n  \"role_plan\": {\n    \"path\": \"plans/architect-01.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"4be065fb9f0cf884fbb8ee3f5c2810403d1f0b02cfa9e5d5e2791786741f1176\"\n  }\n}\n","numLines":838,"startLine":1749,"totalLines":2586}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GmYxGBWLkQx7NQeroV46yC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
